    <string name="disclosure_title">Before you turn it on</string>
    <string name="disclosure_body">The service reads the screen of the X, Instagram, Facebook, TikTok or YouTube app and taps its menu, Block and the confirmation for you. It only acts inside those apps, only when you start blocking, and sends no data anywhere.</string>
